        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 1
        }
      ],
      "en": "God remembered Noah, all the animals, and all the livestock that were with him in the ship; and God made a wind to pass over the earth. The waters subsided.",
      "ko": "하나님이 노아와 그와 함께 방주에 있는 모든 들짐승과 육축을 권념하사 바람으로 땅위에 불게 하시매 물이 감하였고",
      "source_text_hash": "5d154447b05a81d5dea200acc9e081ac3cac7f5a6416b9598b1838ffa5ca9525",
      "translation_text_hash": "5f4dc38ff3fd7d657db7a166cbfe311a3745ccbc8a821eb8c66e71dc56c2a4d6",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
