        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 4
        }
      ],
      "en": "The ship rested in the seventh month, on the seventeenth day of the month, on Ararat’s mountains.",
      "ko": "칠월 곧 그 달 십칠일에 방주가 아라랏산에 머물렀으며",
      "source_text_hash": "a9e6868144a7246c44052f9cb2769e6e947a0dc5ac5b682c0d97e8aff3168bfc",
      "translation_text_hash": "3b30d6dda19f610b7dffe3955f3f1545d73a152d5561ecb5edec59d2c8772911",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "칠월 곧 그 달 십칠일에 방주가 아라랏산에 머물렀으며"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "3b30d6dda19f610b7dffe3955f3f1545d73a152d5561ecb5edec59d2c8772911"
      ]
    },
    {
