      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "GEN",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "and he sent out a raven. It went back and forth, until the waters were dried up from the earth.",
      "ko": "까마귀를 내어 놓으매 까마귀가 물이 땅에서 마르기까지 날아 왕래하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "6088ec853e63268c178efe1917dbd9e490911067cac1835e3e57948038e755ef",
      "translation_text_hash": "8d88b0385e50344ed797719dc24ca35bbffdbc388e14e2782a7caf72943d0eec",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "까마귀를 내어 놓으매 까마귀가 물이 땅에서 마르기까지 날아 왕래하였더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "8d88b0385e50344ed797719dc24ca35bbffdbc388e14e2782a7caf72943d0eec"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:GEN:8:8",
      "sequence": 192,
      "chapter_label": "GEN 8",
