      "en": "He waited yet another seven days; and again he sent the dove out of the ship.",
      "ko": "또 칠일을 기다려 다시 비둘기를 방주에서 내어놓으매",
      "source_text_hash": "276cc143dd364cc2f40400743021b899e76c635294021c8f8062838cf27e4e55",
      "translation_text_hash": "8c5fdcd7f42010570d965a87fa2207bd57bca227337861c5455ee931545a3364",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
